WEBVTT

00:02.702 --> 00:03.411
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.494 --> 00:04.370
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.454 --> 00:05.371
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.455 --> 00:06.664
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.748 --> 00:08.458
Kids:   Aye, aye,
Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊
队长！

00:08.541 --> 00:11.502
Captain: ♪ Ohh... ♪
队长：♪ 哦...♪

00:11.586 --> 00:13.671
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.755 --> 00:15.715
Kids: ♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
孩子们：♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:15.798 --> 00:17.550
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.633 --> 00:19.677
Kids: ♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
孩子们：♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:19.761 --> 00:21.554
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.637 --> 00:23.681
Kids: ♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
孩子们：♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:23.765 --> 00:25.475
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.558 --> 00:26.726
Kids: ♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
孩子们：♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:26.809 --> 00:28.060
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.144 --> 00:29.520
All: ♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
全部：♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:29.604 --> 00:31.564
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:31.647 --> 00:33.608
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪
♪ WhoBob WhatPants ♪

00:33.691 --> 00:37.069
Captain: ♪ WhoBob
WhatPants ♪
队长：♪ WhoBob
什么裤子♪

00:44.327 --> 00:45.912
Man: Patchy the Pirate
presents...
男：海盗帕奇
礼物...

00:45.995 --> 00:49.457
Ahoy, it's a SpongeBob
SquarePants special.
嘿，这是海绵宝宝
方裤特别。

01:12.772 --> 01:14.774
Good morning, Gary.
早上好，加里。

01:16.567 --> 01:18.945
Good morning, Mr. Mailman.
早上好，邮差先生。

01:19.028 --> 01:20.655
'Morning, SpongeBob.
“早上好，海绵宝宝。”

01:20.738 --> 01:23.908
Ah, it  is  a good morning,
isn't it?
啊，这是一个美好的早晨，
不是吗？

01:27.620 --> 01:31.666
Isn't life great, Gary?
生活不是很美好吗，加里？

01:31.749 --> 01:33.543
Oh, what a beautiful day.
噢，多么美好的一天啊。

01:33.626 --> 01:35.294
I have the best friends...
我有最好的朋友...

01:35.378 --> 01:37.755
Ah, stay away!
啊，别走开！

01:37.839 --> 01:41.133
Oh, another SpongeBob nightmare.
哦，又是海绵宝宝的噩梦。

01:41.217 --> 01:43.678
...the best job.
...最好的工作。

01:43.761 --> 01:46.180
He's already 10 seconds late.
他已经迟到了10秒。

01:46.264 --> 01:49.308
I'm docking him
a month's pay for this.
我对接他
为此支付一个月的工资。

01:49.392 --> 01:52.144
And, of course, the bestest pet.
当然，还有最好的宠物。

01:53.396 --> 01:54.939
Ooh...
哦...

02:00.236 --> 02:01.904
I'm sorry!
对不起！

02:01.988 --> 02:04.448
I'm sorry!
对不起！

02:06.117 --> 02:07.451
Patrick: Hi, SpongeBob.
帕特里克：嗨，海绵宝宝。

02:07.535 --> 02:09.036
Hey, Patrick, how goes it?
嘿，帕特里克，怎么样？

02:09.120 --> 02:12.415
Well, it  was  going great
until you showed up.
嗯，进展顺利
直到你出现。

02:12.498 --> 02:13.833
What is that?
那是什么？

02:13.916 --> 02:17.336
Oh, just a birthday cake
for my mom.
哦，只是一个生日蛋糕
为了我妈妈。

02:17.420 --> 02:20.006
That I spent all day baking.
我花了一整天的时间烘烤。

02:23.134 --> 02:25.428
Idiot boy.
白痴男孩。

02:25.511 --> 02:29.599
Ooh, that's the first time
somebody's called me that.
哦哦，这是第一次
有人这么叫我。

02:29.682 --> 02:31.392
Wait, I know who will
enjoy my company.
等等，我知道谁会
享受我的陪伴。

02:31.475 --> 02:35.855
Squidward...
章鱼哥...

02:35.938 --> 02:40.484
Don't you  ever  wake me
from my beauty sleep,
do you understand?
你永远别叫醒我
从我的美容觉中，
你明白吗？

02:40.568 --> 02:42.862
Idiot boy.
白痴男孩。

02:46.574 --> 02:49.452
Whoo-ee, it's all done.
呼呼，一切都完成了。

02:49.535 --> 02:51.746
My greatest invention yet.
我迄今为止最伟大的发明。

02:57.877 --> 03:00.046
Sandy, what a neat robot.
桑迪，多么漂亮的机器人啊。

03:02.632 --> 03:05.885
No...
不...

03:09.805 --> 03:13.017
I can explain, you see,
I was up in a tree
我可以解释一下，你看，
我在树上

03:13.100 --> 03:15.728
and I thought it'd be funny
if I gave you a surprise.
我觉得这会很有趣
如果我给你一个惊喜。

03:15.811 --> 03:17.939
Oh, you gave me a surprise,
all right.
哦，你给了我一个惊喜，
好吧。

03:18.022 --> 03:19.857
Look at the surprise I got!
看看我收到的惊喜吧！

03:19.941 --> 03:24.236
Get out of here... idiot boy.
离开这里...白痴男孩。

03:28.366 --> 03:31.077
A place where I'm wanted
whether they like it or not.
一个我被通缉的地方
不管他们喜欢与否。

03:33.496 --> 03:36.832
SpongeBob Work-Pants
reporting for duty, Mr. Krabs.
海绵宝宝工作裤
克拉布斯先生，来上班了。

03:36.916 --> 03:39.752
Hurry up and get in there, boy,
patties need flippin'.
快点进去吧，孩子，
肉饼需要翻转。

03:39.835 --> 03:41.754
No worries, Cap'n.
不用担心，船长。

03:49.428 --> 03:52.139
Oops, eh, all in a day's work.
哎呀，呃，都是一天的工作。

03:52.223 --> 03:54.058
Now back to doing
what I do best.
现在回到做
我最擅长什么。

03:54.141 --> 03:56.519
No way I can mess this up-
Whoa-oh-oh...
我不可能把这件事搞砸-
哇哦哦...

04:01.857 --> 04:05.111
"Well, hello there."
“嗯，你好。”

04:07.405 --> 04:09.699
What the barnacles is going on?!
藤壶这是怎么回事？！

04:09.782 --> 04:12.201
Mr. Krabs, help...
蟹老板，救命啊……

04:16.455 --> 04:18.708
Mr. Krabs, are you OK?
蟹老板，你还好吗？

04:20.751 --> 04:23.045
As long as me money's OK.
只要我有钱就可以了

04:26.382 --> 04:28.843
Mr. Money: Although we've only
known each other a short time
Mr. Money：虽然我们只
认识时间短

04:28.926 --> 04:31.595
I just wanted you to know,
I love you.
我只是想让你知道，
我爱你。

04:40.229 --> 04:44.191
If I were you, I'd get
as far away from me as possible.
如果我是你，我会得到
离我越远越好。

04:44.275 --> 04:45.651
Idiot boy.
白痴男孩。

04:49.739 --> 04:54.368
If Mr. Krabs is calling me
"idiot boy," it must be true.
如果蟹老板打电话给我
“白痴男孩”，这一定是真的。

04:54.452 --> 04:56.245
I know what must be done.
我知道必须做什么。

05:14.180 --> 05:16.182
I've somehow managed
to make everyone mad at me.
我已经设法
让每个人都生我的气。

05:16.265 --> 05:18.768
At least you still like me,
right, Gar'?
至少你还喜欢我
对吧，加尔？

05:23.189 --> 05:27.568
There's a year's supply
of snail food for you.
有一年的供应量
为你准备蜗牛食物。

05:27.651 --> 05:29.278
Good-bye, pineapple.
再见，菠萝。

05:32.448 --> 05:34.533
Good-bye, Squidward.
再见，章鱼哥。

05:34.617 --> 05:36.202
Good-bye, Patrick.
再见，帕特里克。

05:36.285 --> 05:38.287
Good-bye, Sandy.
再见，桑迪。

05:38.370 --> 05:40.831
Good-bye, Bikini Bottom.
再见，比基尼泳裤。

05:40.915 --> 05:43.709
Good-bye, life as I know it.
再见，我所知道的生活。

05:45.419 --> 05:50.549
"Welcome to Bikini Bottom,
population 538."
“欢迎来到比基尼泳裤，
人口538。”

05:50.633 --> 05:52.802
Minus one.
减一。

06:02.269 --> 06:06.398
Idiot boy, idiot boy,
idiot boy...
白痴男孩，白痴男孩，
白痴男孩...

06:06.482 --> 06:08.734
Idiot boy-
白痴男孩——

06:23.457 --> 06:24.625
Whoa!
哇！

06:34.718 --> 06:38.347
Ooh, boy, that's quite a lump.
哦，孩子，那真是个肿块。

06:52.027 --> 06:53.529
Patrick, where's SpongeBob?
帕特里克，海绵宝宝在哪里？

06:53.612 --> 06:55.156
I don't know.
我不知道。

06:55.239 --> 06:57.658
I've been knocking on
his door for three hours
我一直在敲
他的门三个小时

06:57.741 --> 07:01.203
I need his hot sauce
for my milkshake.
我需要他的辣酱
为了我的奶昔。

07:02.830 --> 07:06.333
We ain't got time for that,
hai-yah!
我们没有时间这么做
哈喽！

07:07.543 --> 07:09.420
Gary, where are you, little guy?
加里，你在哪里，小家伙？

07:11.255 --> 07:12.965
Gary, Gary?
加里，加里？

07:16.594 --> 07:17.678
Gary, what happened to you?
加里，你怎么了？

07:20.806 --> 07:21.974
Sandy: A note.
桑迪：一张纸条。

07:22.057 --> 07:23.809
"To whom it may concern.
“敬启者。

07:23.893 --> 07:26.145
"If you've found this letter
“如果你找到这封信

07:26.228 --> 07:29.982
"that means Gary's food bowl
is empty and that it
needs to be refilled.
“这意味着加里的食物碗
是空的并且它
需要重新填充。

07:30.065 --> 07:33.652
"It also means it's been
approximately one year
since I've split town
“这也意味着它已经
大约一年
自从我分开城镇

07:33.736 --> 07:36.155
"and no one's noticed till now.
“而且到目前为止还没有人注意到。

07:36.238 --> 07:39.366
"No one needs to worry,
I won't bother anyone again.
“没有人需要担心，
我不会再打扰任何人了。

07:39.450 --> 07:41.702
"Sincerely, SpongeBob.
“真诚的，海绵宝宝。

07:41.785 --> 07:45.080
A.K.A. Idiot Boy."
又名白痴男孩。”

07:47.708 --> 07:48.918
Man: I could use this.
男：我可以用这个。

07:49.001 --> 07:50.502
Woman: Yeah, I like these here.
女：是的，我喜欢这里的这些。

07:50.586 --> 07:51.962
Man: Mm, this is top quality,
top quality.
男：嗯，这是顶级品质，
一流的品质。

07:52.046 --> 07:54.465
Hello, there, what's going on?
你好，那边，有什么事吗？

07:54.548 --> 07:55.841
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

07:55.925 --> 07:58.677
Oh, we thought you were
taking a dirt nap
哦，我们以为你是
打个小盹

07:58.761 --> 08:02.848
but, uh, we organized your
clothes for you, SpongeBob.
但是，呃，我们组织了你的
给你的衣服，海绵宝宝。

08:03.682 --> 08:05.017
Are you talking to me?
你在跟我说话吗？

08:05.100 --> 08:07.645
Isn't this your name?
这不是你的名字吗？

08:07.728 --> 08:08.771
I don't know, is it?
我不知道，是吗？

08:08.854 --> 08:10.522
You don't know your name?
你不知道你的名字吗？

08:10.606 --> 08:12.942
All I know is I hit my head
on some rocks.
我只知道我撞到了头
在一些岩石上。

08:13.025 --> 08:14.944
Now I can't seem
to remember anything.
现在我似乎看不到
记住任何事情。

08:16.654 --> 08:19.281
Uh, well, then,  .
呃，那么，。

08:19.365 --> 08:22.618
I'll remind you that these
are  not  your clothes.
我会提醒你这些
不是你的衣服。

08:22.701 --> 08:26.956
And your name  isn't  SpongeBob,
it's, uh, mm...
而且你的名字不是海绵宝宝
这是，呃，嗯……

08:27.039 --> 08:29.708
Uh, Cheese-Head Brown-Pants,
, that's it.
呃，奶酪头棕色裤子，
，就是这样。

08:29.792 --> 08:32.044
Cheese-Head, huh?
奶酪头，是吗？

08:32.127 --> 08:34.547
Wait a minute, what's this?
等一下，这是什么？

08:34.630 --> 08:35.923
Man: Bubbles?
男：泡泡？

08:37.841 --> 08:40.135
I wonder what got into them?
我想知道他们身上发生了什么？

08:42.972 --> 08:46.433
Man: We interrupt this program
for an important announcement.
男：我们中断这个程序
发布重要公告。

08:46.517 --> 08:50.771
Bikini Bottom is literally
in a state of total chaos
tonight- ow!
比基尼泳裤实际上是
处于完全混乱的状态
今晚——噢！

08:50.854 --> 08:53.524
Literally.
字面上地。

08:53.607 --> 08:58.195
We go now to News Sea
Chopper Seven, what's up?
我们现在去新闻海
七号机，怎么了？

08:59.405 --> 09:01.323
Not looking too good
up here, Perch.
看起来不太好
在这里，鲈鱼。

09:01.407 --> 09:03.742
The Krusty Krab is just about
to come apart at the hinges.
蟹堡王大约是
在铰链处分开。

09:03.826 --> 09:07.037
Customers are in a rage over not
getting their Krabby Patties.
顾客因不这样做而愤怒
得到他们的蟹肉饼。

09:07.121 --> 09:08.747
Mr. Krabs: Squidward.
蟹老板：章鱼哥。

09:08.831 --> 09:10.499
Where the barnacles
is SpongeBob?
藤壶在哪里
是海绵宝宝吗？

09:10.582 --> 09:12.084
This place is going
down the toilet.
这个地方要去
下厕所。

09:12.167 --> 09:13.877
Patties need flippin'.
馅饼需要翻转。

09:13.961 --> 09:16.797
If I knew, do you think
I'd be standing here
如果我知道，你觉得
我会站在这里

09:16.880 --> 09:19.341
getting yelled at
by a bunch of morons?
被骂
由一群白痴？

09:19.425 --> 09:22.094
Don't talk back to your
superior officer, you...
不要和你顶嘴
上级长官，你...

09:24.263 --> 09:26.974
Sandy: Squidward, Mr. Krabs,
y'all seen SpongeBob?
桑迪：章鱼哥，蟹老板，
你们都看过海绵宝宝吗？

09:27.057 --> 09:29.101
I think we just
went through this.
我想我们只是
经历过这个。

09:29.184 --> 09:31.937
What he means to say is,
"No, we haven't."
他想说的是，
“不，我们没有。”

09:32.021 --> 09:34.773
Well, apparently,
he's left Bikini Bottom
and he ain't coming back.
嗯，显然，
他离开了比基尼泳裤
他不会回来了。

09:34.857 --> 09:36.358
Let me see that.
让我看看。

09:36.442 --> 09:40.988
"To whom it may concern..."
“敬启者...”

09:41.071 --> 09:43.490
"Akkah, Idiot Boy."
“阿卡，白痴男孩。”

09:43.574 --> 09:45.034
Idiot Boy?!
白痴男孩？！

09:45.117 --> 09:46.619
It  is  SpongeBob.
它是海绵宝宝。

09:46.702 --> 09:49.079
What am I gonna do
without me fry cook?
我要做什么
没有我炒菜吗？

09:49.163 --> 09:52.124
What am I gonna do
without my best friend?
我要做什么
没有我最好的朋友？

09:52.207 --> 09:55.294
I should never have been
mean to you.
我本来就不应该
对你来说意味着。

09:55.377 --> 09:59.965
I should've never
kicked you out of my house.
我不应该
把你赶出了我的房子。

10:00.049 --> 10:04.553
if I'd known that was the last
time I'd ever see SpongeBob
如果我知道那是最后一次
我什么时候能看到海绵宝宝

10:04.636 --> 10:07.681
I would've slammed the door
in his face even harder.
我会关上门
在他脸上更加难受。

10:11.060 --> 10:12.978
All right, group meeting.
好的，小组会议。

10:13.062 --> 10:14.646
Everybody out.
大家都出去吧。

10:14.730 --> 10:18.650
The Krusty Krab's closed
until further notice.
蟹堡王关门了
直至另行通知。

10:18.734 --> 10:22.571
Now how do you propose we find
me money-makin' employee?
现在你建议我们如何找到
我是赚钱的员工吗？

10:28.702 --> 10:30.829
Whoo, I live in a dump.
哇，我住在垃圾场。

10:32.289 --> 10:33.624
Hey, watch where
you're steppin'.
嘿，看哪里
你正在迈步。

10:33.707 --> 10:35.167
Sorry, sir, I was just-
抱歉，先生，我只是——

10:35.250 --> 10:37.336
I know what you was doing,
you was doing
我知道你在做什么
你在做什么

10:37.419 --> 10:41.173
the ol' "bump into the sucker
and reach into his pockets
and take his change" routine.
ol'“撞到吸盘上
然后把手伸进口袋
并接受他的改变”例行公事。

10:41.256 --> 10:42.841
Well, it ain't gonna
work  this  time.
嗯，这不会
这次工作。

10:42.925 --> 10:45.886
You want money,
get a job, you deadbeat.
你想要钱，
找份工作吧，你这个赖账者。

10:45.969 --> 10:48.430
I'm a jobless deadbeat?
我是一个无业游民吗？

10:48.514 --> 10:51.392
What a sad existence
I don't remember I lead.
多么可悲的存在
我不记得我是领导者。

10:58.524 --> 11:01.568
Ooh, seems like
I'm running on empty.
哦哦，好像
我空空地跑。

11:04.488 --> 11:07.032
Aw, I guess if I want to
fill the hole in my gut
噢，我想如果我愿意的话
填补我肠道中的空洞

11:07.116 --> 11:09.410
I'll need to
fill a job somewhere.
我需要
在某处填补一份工作。

11:09.493 --> 11:11.537
"Help wanted"?
“把招工广告”？

11:11.620 --> 11:17.501
Well, Mr. Brown-Pants,
you seem to have left
this entire application blank.
嗯，棕色裤子先生，
你好像已经离开了
整个申请表都是空白的。

11:20.003 --> 11:22.423
Well, do you have
any special skills?
嗯，你有吗
有什么特殊技能吗？

11:22.506 --> 11:25.050
Special skills?
特殊技能？

11:25.134 --> 11:27.136
Oh, I can do this...
哦，我可以做到这一点...

11:31.223 --> 11:33.308
What do you think you're doing?
你认为你在做什么？

11:34.893 --> 11:39.481
Sorry, sir, but we run
a respectable business here.
对不起，先生，但我们跑了
这里是一家受人尊敬的企业。

11:39.565 --> 11:42.443
OK, I guess they don't want you
blowing bubbles
好吧，我猜他们不想要你
吹泡泡

11:42.526 --> 11:44.695
unless it directly relates
to the job at hand.
除非直接相关
到手头的工作。

11:47.906 --> 11:50.242
Thanks for the job, boss,
you won't be disappointed.
感谢老板的工作，
你不会失望的。

11:50.325 --> 11:54.288
That's real sweet, Brown-Pants,
but I don't hear that
hammer pounding.
真的很可爱，棕色裤子，
但我没听到
锤子敲击。

11:55.664 --> 11:58.500
Then this must be
music to your ears.
那么这一定是
音乐传到你的耳朵里。

12:04.131 --> 12:06.675
You aren't doing that on my
building site, you're fired.
你没有对我这样做
建筑工地，你被解雇了。

12:10.012 --> 12:12.723
I do  not  understand this.
我不明白这一点。

12:12.806 --> 12:15.642
What is wrong with this city?
这座城市出了什么问题？

12:15.726 --> 12:18.270
Maybe it's not the city,
maybe it's me.
或许这不是一座城市
也许是我。

12:18.353 --> 12:20.856
Hey, mister, look at me,
mister, look at me!
嘿，先生，看着我，
先生，看着我！

12:20.939 --> 12:24.151
Is there something
wrong with me?
有什么东西吗
我错了吗？

12:29.031 --> 12:30.532
Sandy: Listen up, y'all.
桑迪：你们听着。

12:30.616 --> 12:32.493
I've got a plan
to bring back SpongeBob.
我有一个计划
把海绵宝宝带回来。

12:32.576 --> 12:33.410
You do?
你做？

12:33.494 --> 12:35.412
Yup, and it involves this.
是的，它涉及到这一点。

12:35.496 --> 12:37.789
It'll track any sponge
within a 50-mile radius.
它会追踪任何海绵
50 英里半径内。

12:40.042 --> 12:44.880
Oh, you're saying this thing
can actually  find  SpongeBob?
哦，你说的是这个
真的能找到海绵宝宝吗？

12:44.963 --> 12:46.548
You got it, Squid-cakes.
你明白了，鱿鱼饼。

12:46.632 --> 12:48.300
But it's gonna take
all of us to find-
但这需要
我们所有人都要找到——

12:55.724 --> 12:57.017
Oops, I dropped it.
哎呀，我把它掉了。

12:59.603 --> 13:02.981
Mr. Squidward!
章鱼哥先生！

13:03.065 --> 13:06.985
This device was me
last chance to get this place
back into ship-shape.
这个设备就是我
获得这个地方的最后机会
恢复成船形。

13:07.069 --> 13:10.489
And since you destroyed it, I'm
ordering  you  to find SpongeBob.
自从你毁了它以来，我
命令你找到海绵宝宝。

13:12.407 --> 13:16.328
I wouldn't seek out that twit
for all the leotards in the sea.
我不会去找那个傻瓜
对于海里所有的紧身衣。

13:16.411 --> 13:20.165
If you don't find him,
you'll be out of a job forever.
如果你找不到他
你将永远失业。

13:20.249 --> 13:22.834
Ha, is that your version
of a threat?
哈，是你的版本吗
威胁？

13:22.918 --> 13:26.630
Oh, Squidward, don't forget
your retirement gift.
哦，章鱼哥，别忘了
您的退休礼物。

13:26.713 --> 13:29.591
Squidward: Mr. Krabs,
I am not interested in any-
章鱼哥：蟹老板先生，
我对任何事情都不感兴趣——

13:34.304 --> 13:36.473
That'll complete my collection.
这将完成我的收藏。

13:36.557 --> 13:38.850
Oh, thank you, thank you,
thank you, Mr. Krabs.
哦，谢谢你，谢谢你，
谢谢你，蟹老板。

13:38.934 --> 13:40.477
Not so fast.
没那么快。

13:40.561 --> 13:43.438
Bring back me number-one
fry cook first.
把我带回第一
先炒煮。

13:51.446 --> 13:53.365
Real drag, isn't it?
真正的阻力，不是吗？

13:53.448 --> 13:56.076
Having to stand around a fire
for warmth every night.
必须站在火边
为了每一个夜晚的温暖。

13:56.159 --> 13:57.119
Yeah.
是的。

13:57.202 --> 13:58.745
Hey, not for us.
嘿，不适合我们。

13:58.829 --> 14:00.956
We're just waiting in line
for a new video game.
我们只是在排队等候
一个新的视频游戏。

14:01.039 --> 14:04.918
I guess I am just
a jobless deadbeat.
我想我只是
一个无业游民

14:05.002 --> 14:06.962
You guys mind if I bubble?
你们介意我冒泡泡吗？

14:08.171 --> 14:09.881
You can't do that here.
你不能在这里这样做。

14:09.965 --> 14:13.385
But bubbles will steady
the old nerves, watch.
但泡沫将会稳定下来
老神经，看吧。

14:16.221 --> 14:17.889
Ah, see, feeling better already.
啊，看吧，感觉好多了。

14:24.062 --> 14:25.105
Don't look.
别看。

14:49.838 --> 14:51.423
Do you have any-
你有没有——

14:51.506 --> 14:54.426
I think we've made our point
with the snapping.
我想我们已经表达了我们的观点
随着啪的一声。

14:54.509 --> 14:58.597
As I was saying, do you have
any idea who we are?
正如我所说，你有
知道我们是谁吗？

14:58.680 --> 15:01.224
Um, hold on, wait-wait,
don't stop me, um-
嗯，等等，等等，
别阻止我，嗯-

15:01.308 --> 15:03.352
Don't answer.
不要回答。

15:03.435 --> 15:05.062
I'll show you.
我会告诉你。

15:05.145 --> 15:08.231
We call us
the Bubble-Poppin' Boys.
我们打电话给我们
泡泡男孩。

15:08.315 --> 15:12.903
And Article One of our charter
prohibits bubble blowing
on our turf.
以及我们章程的第一条
禁止吹泡泡
在我们的地盘上。

15:18.116 --> 15:21.828
You see why we don't
allow bubbles in our city?
你知道为什么我们不这样做
允许我们的城市出现泡沫吗？

15:21.912 --> 15:27.709
Fortunately, we have ways
of dealing with careless
bubble-blowers like you.
幸运的是，我们有办法
处理粗心的
像你这样吹泡泡的人

15:28.460 --> 15:32.297
Let's  rough  him up, boys.
孩子们，让我们粗暴地对待他吧。

15:34.257 --> 15:35.967
Where'd he go?
他去哪儿了？

15:36.051 --> 15:37.427
After him.
在他之后。

16:02.953 --> 16:06.039
Ah, I'll be making
this getaway in comfort.
啊，我会做
这次舒适的度假。

16:43.577 --> 16:46.538
Do you realize what you've done?
你意识到你做了什么吗？

16:46.621 --> 16:47.539
No...
不...

16:47.622 --> 16:49.541
You have freed this city.
你解放了这座城市。

16:49.624 --> 16:52.461
Citizens of New Kelp,
come out of the shadows
新海带的公民们，
走出阴影

16:52.544 --> 16:56.631
'cause Cheese-Boy kicked
the Bubble-Poppin' gang
right out of town.
因为奶酪男孩踢了
泡泡帮
就在城外。

17:04.639 --> 17:06.850
Thank you, Cheese-Boy.
谢谢你，奶酪男孩。

17:06.933 --> 17:10.187
What an amazing gift
Cheese-Boy has given us.
多么奇妙的礼物啊
奶酪男孩给了我们。

17:10.270 --> 17:11.396
Actually, it's Cheese-Head.
事实上，它是奶酪头。

17:13.064 --> 17:15.400
Well, Cheese-Head
好吧，奶酪头

17:15.484 --> 17:17.819
this is an historic day
for New Kelp City.
这是历史性的一天
为新海带城。

17:17.903 --> 17:21.740
You have rid this city
of the Bubble-Poppin' Boys.
你已经摆脱了这座城市
泡泡男孩的成员。

17:21.823 --> 17:25.911
And restored bubble-blowing
to the streets.
并恢复吹泡泡
到街上。

17:25.994 --> 17:29.164
Something I wasn't able
to do for 20 years as mayor.
一些我无法做到的事情
当了20年市长。

17:29.247 --> 17:35.504
For this, I appoint you
mayor of New Kelp City.
为此，我任命你
新海带市市长。

17:37.756 --> 17:40.550
Long live Mayor Cheese-Head.
奶酪头市长万岁。

17:44.137 --> 17:45.013
Sandy: SpongeBob...
桑迪：海绵宝宝……

17:45.096 --> 17:46.932
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

17:47.015 --> 17:48.600
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

17:51.853 --> 17:53.939
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

17:54.022 --> 17:56.566
Maybe someone at that truck stop
has seen our porous
little buddy.
也许那个卡车停靠站有人
看到了我们的多孔
小伙伴。

17:58.276 --> 18:00.153
Patrick: SpongeBob!
帕特里克：海绵宝宝！

18:00.237 --> 18:01.446
There he is, guys.
他就在那里，伙计们。

18:01.530 --> 18:02.948
Huh?
啊？

18:04.574 --> 18:06.326
Oh, I knew I'd find you, buddy.
哦，我就知道我会找到你，伙计。

18:06.409 --> 18:09.663
Look at you, you haven't
changed a bit.
看看你，你还没有
改变了一点。

18:09.746 --> 18:12.123
Let's go home and eat
a gallon of sea-nut butter.
我们回家吃饭吧
一加仑海坚果酱。

18:12.207 --> 18:14.209
That's not SpongeBob, Patrick.
那不是海绵宝宝，帕特里克。

18:14.292 --> 18:17.129
There's SpongeBob.
有海绵宝宝。

18:18.880 --> 18:21.258
I'll get you out of
this cage, buddy.
我会把你救出来
这个笼子，伙计。

18:21.341 --> 18:24.344
You're safe now in my arms.
你现在在我怀里很安全。

18:24.427 --> 18:26.388
Huh, well, where'd you go now?
嗯，那么，你现在去哪儿了？

18:28.515 --> 18:29.933
Uh, Pat?
呃，帕特？

18:30.016 --> 18:31.726
All the ink came off
on your belly.
所有墨水都脱落了
在你的肚子上。

18:31.810 --> 18:33.144
Oh.
哦。

18:33.228 --> 18:35.480
Now let's see what that
little critter's up to.
现在让我们看看那是什么
小动物在做什么。

18:35.564 --> 18:36.982
"New Mayor of-"
“新任市长——”

18:37.065 --> 18:40.110
SpongeBob's mayor of
New Kelp City.
海绵宝宝的市长
新海带城。

18:41.403 --> 18:43.613
Citizens of New Kelp City.
新海带市的市民。

18:43.697 --> 18:46.992
I don't know much about politics
or balanced budgets
我对政治了解不多
或平衡预算

18:47.075 --> 18:48.952
or how to be a "leader."
或者如何成为“领导者”。

18:49.035 --> 18:52.956
I'm not exactly sure
what a "mayor" "is."
我不太确定
“市长”是什么？

18:53.039 --> 18:57.711
But I do know this, while I am
wearing the mayor's hat
但我确实知道这一点
戴着市长的帽子

18:57.794 --> 19:02.507
it will always be safe to blow
bubbles on the streets
of New Kelp
吹起来总是安全的
街道上的泡泡
新海带

19:02.591 --> 19:06.386
or my name isn't
Cheese-Head Brown-Pants.
或者我的名字不是
奶酪头棕色裤子。

19:08.763 --> 19:11.016
Cheese-Head Brown-Pants?
奶酪头棕色裤子？

19:11.099 --> 19:14.853
New Kelp City has
Brown-Pants mania.
新海带城有
棕色裤子狂热。

19:18.398 --> 19:19.983
Sandy: Hang on a minute.
桑迪：等一下。

19:20.066 --> 19:22.027
I don't mean to put a damper
on the mood here
我并不是有意要放一个阻尼器
关于这里的心情

19:22.110 --> 19:24.362
but Bikini Bottom
needs you back, SpongeBob.
但比基尼下装
需要你回来，海绵宝宝。

19:24.446 --> 19:26.197
What's that?
那是什么？

19:26.281 --> 19:27.824
Well, I'm sorry
I yelled at you, buddy.
嗯，对不起
我对你大喊大叫，伙计。

19:27.908 --> 19:30.285
Oh, this is a surprise.
哦，这真是一个惊喜。

19:30.368 --> 19:31.953
Surprised I found you?
很惊讶我发现了你？

19:32.037 --> 19:33.538
No, surprised at seeing
a talking weasel.
不，看到后很惊讶
一只会说话的黄鼠狼

19:36.458 --> 19:38.627
Don't pretend you don't
remember me, SpongeBob.
不要假装你不这样做
请记住我，海绵宝宝。

19:38.710 --> 19:40.670
Sorry... Sandy.
抱歉...桑迪。

19:40.754 --> 19:42.422
But I'd probably remember
an underwater, talking weasel.
但我可能会记得
一只在水下会说话的黄鼠狼。

19:42.505 --> 19:45.091
You may not remember the weasel
你可能不记得黄鼠狼

19:45.175 --> 19:48.929
but you haven't forgotten
your best friend, have you?
但你没有忘记
你最好的朋友，是吗？

19:51.514 --> 19:53.767
I have no idea
how that got there.
我不知道
那是怎么到那里的。

19:53.850 --> 19:57.395
All I remember is hitting
my head, blowing some bubbles
and now, poof, I'm mayor.
我只记得击打
我的头，吹着泡泡
现在，噗，我是市长了。

19:57.479 --> 19:59.397
You must've lost your memory
when you hit your head.
你一定是失去了记忆
当你撞到你的头时。

19:59.481 --> 20:02.234
You'll just have to come back
with us to Bikini Bottom.
你只需要回来
和我们一起去比基尼堡。

20:02.317 --> 20:04.569
The familiar surroundings will
bring your memory right back.
熟悉的环境将
立即恢复你的记忆。

20:04.653 --> 20:06.863
Uh, sorry, weasel girl,
I can't leave.
呃，对不起，黄鼠狼女孩，
我不能离开。

20:06.947 --> 20:09.074
These people need my leadership.
这些人需要我的领导。

20:09.157 --> 20:13.078
In fact, I'm late for a meeting.
事实上，我开会迟到了。

20:13.161 --> 20:15.163
Sandy: SpongeBob, wait!
桑迪：海绵宝宝，等等！

20:16.957 --> 20:18.416
Don't just stand there, get in.
别只是站在那里，进去吧。

20:18.500 --> 20:19.542
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

20:20.627 --> 20:22.879
Decorative egg, here I come.
装饰蛋，我来了。

20:27.008 --> 20:28.218
here it is.
这里是。

20:28.301 --> 20:29.761
You must recognize this place.
你一定认得这个地方。

20:29.844 --> 20:30.762
Nope.
没有。

20:30.845 --> 20:32.347
Don't recognize the Krusty Krab?
不认识蟹堡王？

20:32.430 --> 20:34.766
Stop your kidding, boy.
别开玩笑了，孩子。

20:34.849 --> 20:36.351
And start frying up
them patties.
And start frying up
他们肉饼。

20:36.434 --> 20:38.770
I was a fry cook before?
我以前是炒菜的吗？

20:38.853 --> 20:40.730
Aye, the best in the business.
是的，业内最好的。

20:40.814 --> 20:42.482
Now get flippin'.
现在开始吧。

20:42.565 --> 20:44.359
Look, guys,
as much as I'd love to
瞧，伙计们，
尽我所能

20:44.442 --> 20:46.277
toil the days away
flipping burgers
辛苦劳作的日子
翻转汉堡

20:46.361 --> 20:49.322
I think I'll just
go back to my modest job
as mayor of a major city.
我想我只会
回到我平凡的工作
作为一个大城市的市长。

20:49.406 --> 20:52.909
Whoo-hoo-hoo,
SpongeBob's leaving for real
this time.
呼呼呼，
海绵宝宝真的要离开了
这次。

20:52.993 --> 20:55.537
Mr. Krabs, I brought back
your number-one fry cook.
蟹老板，我带回来了
你的第一名炒菜厨师。

20:55.620 --> 20:57.163
You  gotta pay up.
你得还钱。

20:57.247 --> 20:59.499
All right, Mr. Squidward,
a deal's a deal.
好吧，章鱼哥先生，
协议就是协议。

20:59.582 --> 21:01.710
Here's your fancy egg.
这是你的精美鸡蛋。

21:01.793 --> 21:04.963
Oh, it's beautiful.
哦，很漂亮。

21:09.175 --> 21:13.179
No...
不...

21:18.768 --> 21:20.812
You OK, SpongeBob?
你还好吗，海绵宝宝？

21:24.065 --> 21:25.775
Hey, I remember this place.
嘿，我记得这个地方。

21:25.859 --> 21:27.360
SpongeBob's back.
海绵宝宝回来了。

21:27.444 --> 21:29.446
We're really sorry
we ran you out of town, boy.
我们真的很抱歉
我们把你赶出了城，孩子。

21:29.529 --> 21:31.573
But we're glad you're back.
但我们很高兴你回来了。

21:31.656 --> 21:35.952
I'd really love to stay,
but the people of New Kelp City
need their mayor.
我真的很想留下来
但新海带城的人们
需要他们的市长。

21:36.911 --> 21:38.663
Good-bye, everyone.
再见，大家。

21:38.747 --> 21:39.831
Huh?
啊？

21:38.747 --> 21:39.831
Oh, not again.
哦，不会了。

21:39.914 --> 21:42.751
He's leaving... Again.
他要离开……再一次。

21:42.834 --> 21:45.670
Man on TV: Stop what
you're doing and  don't
go out that door.
电视里的人：停下来
你正在做和没有做
走出那扇门。

21:45.754 --> 21:47.714
This is a K-N-K-C
special report.
这是一个 K-N-K-C
特别报告。

21:47.797 --> 21:49.841
Panic in the streets
of New Kelp City
街头一片恐慌
新海带城

21:49.924 --> 21:53.303
as rampant bubbles bring
visibility down to zero.
正如猖獗的泡沫带来的
能见度降至零。

21:53.386 --> 21:56.639
The angry citizens here blame
the apocalyptic scene
这里愤怒的市民指责
世界末日的场景

21:56.723 --> 22:00.894
on Mayor Cheese-Head Brown-Pants
and his newly-enacted
bubble policy.
市长奶酪头棕色裤子
以及他新制定的
泡沫政策。

22:00.977 --> 22:03.855
If I ever see
Mayor Brown-Pants again
如果我见过
又是棕裤市长

22:03.938 --> 22:05.940
I'm gonna grab his little,
yellow head
我要抓住他的小
黄头

22:06.024 --> 22:08.068
and literally rip his-
并从字面上撕裂他的-

22:11.362 --> 22:12.822
Where's SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝在哪里？

22:15.075 --> 22:17.702
Who wants to be a dumb
old mayor when you're
the best fry cook in town?
谁愿意当个傻子
老市长当你
城里最好的炒菜厨师？

22:21.456 --> 22:22.582
Oh, boy, oh, boy, oh, boy...
哦，男孩，哦，男孩，哦，男孩……

22:22.665 --> 22:26.711
Krabby Patty.
克拉比·帕蒂。

22:26.795 --> 22:30.131
SpongeBob, another masterpiece.
海绵宝宝，又一杰作。

22:30.215 --> 22:32.425
It's great to have you
back, Spongey.
很高兴有你
回来吧，海绵。

22:34.094 --> 22:37.222
Looks like I'm back in
Bikini Bottom forever.
看来我又回来了
永远的比基尼泳裤。

看来我又回来了
永远的比基尼泳裤。